ontent","notes":"This product is made with natural ingredients."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Contains no artificial colors or preservatives."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CERTIFIED RENEWABLE ENERGY (R)\nGreen.e.org"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"We buy 100% Certified Renewable Energy"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product in not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Recyclable Bottle"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"(C) 2006 Garden of Life"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"This product is packed by weight not volume."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if safety seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"PMC65BL-042210-050710"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Perfect Meal(R) features Fibertrol(R), our own special fiber blend that helps you feel full longer, reducing hunger and cravings that can lead to overeating during meals and overindulging on unhealthy snacks between meal."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Perfect Meal(R) provides a multi-faceted approach to healthy weight management.+"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Enjoy great-tasting Perfect Meal(R), along with sensible diet and regular physical activity, as a meaningful solution to managing your weight."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Whole food based chromium and calcium - No isolates  -No stimulants or artificial sweeteners Low glycemic index-Regular consumption of foods with a low glycemic index is associated with optimal weight."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Reduces Hunger and Food Cravings!+*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Effective and Healthy Weight Management+* \nDeliciously Satisfying \n19 Grams of Fiber"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten Free"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURALLY FLAVORED"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Low Glycemic Index"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"ALONG WITH A HEALTHY DIET AND EXERCISE"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Adults mix two scoops of Perfect Meal(R) in at least 8 ounces of water and drink immediately to satisfy your appetite. If desired, take Perfect Meal(R) about 1 hour before one or two meals each day."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not intended for children."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"1. Fibertrol and Whey Protein help you take control of your appetite so you consume fewer calories between meals.\n2. Glycemic Balance Blend and Fibertrol slow digestion of carbohydrates to help maintain already healthy blood sugar levels and glycermic response for balanced energy. 1\n3. Proprietary Probiotic Blend supports your digestive system to maximize the benefits of a healthy diet. +"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: This product should be taken with at least a full glass of liquid. Consuming this product without enough liquid may cause choking. Do not consume this product if you have difficulty in swallowing."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"CAUTION: As with any dietary supplement, consult your healthcare practitioner before using this product, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, anticipate surgery, take medications on a regular basis or are otherwise under medical supervision."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Perfect Meal(R) is a delicious and satisfying high protein and fiber dietary supplement that will help you successfully manage your weight by naturally curbing your appetite. 1"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Made in the U.S.A."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"By eating less and decreasing your caloric intake, your weight management goals are within reach. Fibertrol, along with the Glycemic Balance Blend, helps maintain already healthy blood sugar metabolism for balanced energy levels and reduced food cravings. Fibertrol also contains nutrients that help maintain cholesterol levels already in the healthy range, including organic oat beta glucan to support a healthy heart."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"6 58010 11260 4","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}